usage: launch.py [-h] [--mode {annotate,convert}] [--input-dir INPUT_DIR]
                 [--csv-path CSV_PATH] [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]
                 [--execution-mode {standard,semantic-only}]
                 [--iterations ITERATIONS_OVERRIDE] [--start START]
                 [--end END] [--interactive-range]
                 [--debug-semantic-focus-dir DEBUG_AC0811_DIR]
                 [--debug-element-diff-dir DEBUG_ELEMENT_DIFF_DIR]
                 [--debug-jpeg-load] [--debug-trace [PATH]] [--bootstrap-deps]
                 [--ac08-regression-set]
                 [--ac08-regression-variant {AC0800_L,AC0800_M,AC0800_S,AC0811_L,AC0811_M,AC0811_S,AC0882_S,AC0837_L,AC0839_S,AC0820_L,AC0831_L,AC0834_S,AC0835_S,AC0812_M}]
                 [--log-file LOG_FILE] [--print-linux-vendor-command]
                 [--vendor-dir VENDOR_DIR] [--vendor-platform VENDOR_PLATFORM]
                 [--vendor-python-version VENDOR_PYTHON_VERSION]
                 [--isolate-svg-render]
                 [--isolate-svg-render-timeout-sec ISOLATE_SVG_RENDER_TIMEOUT_SEC]
                 [--deterministic-order] [--repair-valve-head-bestlist]
                 [--fail-on-batch-failures]
                 [--fail-on-optimization-render-regression]
                 [folder_path] [csv_or_output] [iterations]

Verarbeite einen Bildordner entweder im Analysemodus (Bounding-Boxes/JSON) oder im Konvertierungsmodus (SVG-/Diff-/Report-Ausgaben).

positional arguments:
  folder_path           Pfad zum Ordner mit den Bildern (Default:
                        artifacts/images_to_convert)
  csv_or_output         Optional: Pfad zur CSV/TSV/XML-Export-Tabelle ODER
                        Ausgabeverzeichnis f�r konvertierte Dateien.
                        (Kompatibilit�t: bisheriger 2. Positionsparameter)
  iterations            Anzahl der Iterationen (optional, default: 64; f�r
                        Tiefensuche explizit erh�hen)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {annotate,convert}
                        annotate=markiere Kreis/Kellenstiel/Schrift und
                        schreibe Koordinaten; convert=SVG-Konvertierung mit
                        Reports
  --input-dir INPUT_DIR
